@startuml project_components
title OpenCRM — слои проектов приложения

top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

component "OpenCRM.WebApp\nточка композиции / HTTP-хост" as Web
component "OpenCRM.Modules.*\nмодули приложения" as Modules
component "Infrastructure.Auth / Admin / Payments / FileStorage" as Infrastructure
component "Services.Interfaces\nобщие сервисные контракты" as ServiceContracts
component "Modules.*.Contracts\nконтракты модулей и DTO" as ModuleContracts
component "Infrastructure.Data\nEF Core / Identity" as Data
component "Domain.Interfaces\nабстракции репозиториев и unit of work" as DomainInterfaces
component "Domain\nсущности и правила" as Domain

Web --> Infrastructure
Web --> Modules
Modules --> ServiceContracts
Modules --> ModuleContracts
Modules --> Data
Modules --> Domain
Infrastructure --> ServiceContracts
Infrastructure --> Data
Infrastructure --> Domain
Data --> DomainInterfaces
Data --> Domain
ServiceContracts --> ModuleContracts
ServiceContracts --> Domain
ModuleContracts --> Domain
DomainInterfaces --> Domain

note right of ServiceContracts
  Services.Interfaces ссылается на Domain и контракты модулей.
  Ссылок на Infrastructure.Data или EF Core у него нет.
end note

note bottom of Web
  WebApp связывает модули и инфраструктуру в один хост.
  Payments.Service и Notifications.Worker — отдельные проекты сервисов.
end note

@enduml
